            ("p", "This is the same structural failure described in <a href=\"../lidl-digital-transformation-failure/\">the Lidl case</a>: reporting stayed calm and clean while the underlying reality drifted, because the layers that could have raised the alarm shared the same assumptions as the layers receiving the report."),

